WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:07.424
The largest insect migration in the world ends each year in Michoacan, Mexico

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:13.824
Millions of monarch butterflies travel from across the U.S. and Canada

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.200
Some flying close to 3000 miles

00:00:19.456 --> 00:00:24.064
to pass the cold months in the towering trees of this beautiful forest

